      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i've been feeling kinda down lately and just generally low energy w the weather changing. thinking about trying st johns wort to help with my mood but i am on the pill (estrogen/progestin) do u think that would be okay to take? or is there a specific dose u recommend?",
