      "content": "oh wow ok thanks for the warning. i didnt realize it could do that. i've heard from some people that it's just a natural herb so it shouldn't mess with anything that big... are u sure it actually affects the pill that much? like is there a way i could take it safely, maybe just a really small dose or something at night so it doesnt interfere?",
